0% Blancheporte</a></p><hr><p><div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://fnty.co/c/r-DQZuaCMy\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Profiter du code -40% <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>Toutes les offres Blancheporte en cours</h2><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"comparison-table\"><thead><tr>\n<th>Offre</th><th>Detail</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>-40% des 2 articles</strong></td>\n<td>Code <strong>899004</strong> a saisir dans le panier</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>-25% tenues de ceremonie</strong></td>\n<td>Sur la selection mariage et evenements</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Tote bag offert</strong></td>\n<td>En cadeau sur la commande</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Casquette offerte</strong></td>\n<td>En cadeau sur la commande</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><hr><p><div id=\"ezoic-pub-ad-placeholder-203\" class=\"ad-container\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"></div><h2>Ce qu'on trouve chez Blancheporte</h2><p>Blancheporte, c'est un catalogue mode et maison qui existe depuis plus de 200 ans. On y trouve surtout :</p><ul><li><strong>Mode femme</strong> — robes, tuniques, pantalons, vestes, du 36 au 58</li>\n<li><strong>Lingerie et maillots de bain</strong> — grandes tailles incluses</li>\n<li><strong>Tenues de ceremonie</strong> — robes habillees, ensembles, accessoires mariage</li>\n<li><strong>Linge de maison</strong> — draps, rideaux, nappes, decoration</li>\n</ul>\n<hr></p><p><div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://fnty.co/c/r-DQZuaCMy\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Profiter du code -40% <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>Notre avis</h2><p>Le code <strong>899004</strong> est interessant a condition d'acheter au moins 2 articles — ce qui est facile vu la largeur du catalogue. La remise de -25% sur les tenues de ceremonie tombe bien avec la saison des mariages qui approche. Les cadeaux (tote bag + casquette) sont un petit bonus appreciable.</p><p>> <a href=\"https://fnty.co/c/r-DQZuaCMy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir les offres Blancheporte</a>\n</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"article-content\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L13\",null,{}]\n9:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"margin\":\"40px 0\",\"padding\":\"32px\",\"background\":\"linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF0F0 0%, #FFF8F0 100%)\",\"borderRadius\":\"16px\",\"border\":\"2px solid #FECDD3\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":800,\"fontSize\":\"1.2rem\",\"marginBottom\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"var(--foreground)\"},\"children\":\"Profiter de cette offre\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://fnty.co/c/r-DQZuaCMy\",\"className\":\"btn btn-primary\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"nofollow sponsored noopener\",\"style\":{\"padding\":\"14px 32px\",\"fontSize\":\"1rem\"},\"children\":[\"Profiter du code -40%\",\" \",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":15,\"height\":15,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide luc